 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Six Command Prompt commands every Windows user should know.",
   "s": 0.06,
   "e": 3.686
  },
  {
   "text": "Number six closes a frozen app in one second.",
   "s": 4.106,
   "e": 6.848
  },
  {
   "text": "First, press Windows and R, type C M D, and press Enter.",
   "s": 7.268,
   "e": 11.214
  },
  {
   "text": "Command one: I P config.",
   "s": 11.634,
   "e": 13.348
  },
  {
   "text": "It shows your PC's address on your home network, on the line that says I P v 4 Address.",
   "s": 13.768,
   "e": 19.581
  },
  {
   "text": "Command two: I P config, slash flush D N S.",
   "s": 20.001,
   "e": 23.393
  },
  {
   "text": "If a website won't load, this clears the old saved addresses, so you can try again.",
   "s": 23.813,
   "e": 28.766
  },
  {
   "text": "Command three: system info.",
   "s": 29.186,
   "e": 30.945
  },
  {
   "text": "Scroll up to the top, and you'll see your Windows version and how much RAM you have.",
   "s": 31.365,
   "e": 36.038
  },
  {
   "text": "Command four: driver query.",
   "s": 36.458,
   "e": 38.268
  },
  {
   "text": "It lists every driver installed on your PC, by name and type.",
   "s": 38.688,
   "e": 42.469
  },
  {
   "text": "Command five: task list.",
   "s": 42.889,
   "e": 44.493
  },
  {
   "text": "It shows every app and process that's running right now, with its name.",
   "s": 44.913,
   "e": 48.874
  },
  {
   "text": "Command six: task kill.",
   "s": 49.294,
   "e": 50.754
  },
  {
   "text": "Type task kill, slash I M, then the app's name, then slash F, and press Enter.",
   "s": 51.174,
   "e": 56.323
  },
  {
   "text": "The frozen app closes right away, but anything unsaved in it is lost.",
   "s": 56.743,
   "e": 61.309
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this video, so you have these commands when you need them.",
   "s": 61.729,
   "e": 64.916
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow for more Windows fixes every day.",
   "s": 65.336,
   "e": 67.57
  }
 ]
}